{"seq":2,"slug":"service-capacity-plan","title":"网点处理容量与排班","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-network-capacity/service-capacity-plan","wordCount":2507,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"网点处理容量与排班\">网点处理容量与排班</h1><p>马德里的一家授权维修点在某周二上午连续收到六张派单，系统当时认为它有六个工位的空余。实际情况是：两位技师休假，一位在等一件昨天就该到的备件而工位被占着，剩下的有效产能只够接三台。三家用户在同一天收到了&quot;您的设备已受理&quot;的消息，其中三台在网点躺了四天没人动。</p>\n<p>这段失败暴露的不是分派算法的错，而是它的输入——<strong>&quot;容量&quot;这个数字本身的定义错了</strong>。本篇要把&quot;网点能接多少单&quot;从一个被随手填写的整数，变成一个由工位、工时、排班、作业时长与在制品共同推导出来的、带置信度与时间窗的可承诺量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>处理容量（throughput capacity）与服务能力一样，是一个<strong>随时间变化的函数</strong>而非一个标量。它回答的是&quot;从明天起的两周内，这个网点还能接下多少张指定类型的维修单，并承诺在第 N 个工作日完成&quot;。这个定义里有四个必须显式给出的元素：时间窗、机型的作业时长假设、可用工时的计算口径、以及在制品（WIP）的占用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[物理工位数 stations] --&gt; D[可用工位工时&lt;br/&gt;available station-hours]&#10;    B[技师数 × 技能矩阵] --&gt; D&#10;    C[排班与节假日 calendar] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[单机作业时长的分布]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可承诺量 ATP]&#10;    G[在制品 WIP 占用] --&gt; F&#10;    H[预留缓冲 for 返修/加急] --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; I[带置信区间的承诺]&#10;    I --&gt; J[第二章分派作为硬约束之一]\">graph TD\n    A[物理工位数 stations] --&gt; D[可用工位工时&lt;br/&gt;available station-hours]\n    B[技师数 × 技能矩阵] --&gt; D\n    C[排班与节假日 calendar] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[单机作业时长的分布]\n    E --&gt; F[可承诺量 ATP]\n    G[在制品 WIP 占用] --&gt; F\n    H[预留缓冲 for 返修/加急] --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; I[带置信区间的承诺]\n    I --&gt; J[第二章分派作为硬约束之一]</pre><p>容量模型的第一个陷阱是把&quot;工位数&quot;直接当成产能。一个工位不是一个可以无限排队的处理器——它需要<strong>一个具备对应技能的技师、一把对应的工具、以及一块不在维修中的空间</strong>同时到位。这三者中任何一个缺席，工位就是不可用的。所以可用工位工时应当写成技能与工具约束下的最小值，而不是物理工位数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{avail} = \\sum_{s \\in S} \\sum_{t \\in T} \\min\\left(n^{station}_s,\\ n^{tech}_{s,t},\\ n^{tool}_{s,t}\\right) \\cdot h_t \\cdot u_{s,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是工位集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是可用班次集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{tech}_{s,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是具有该工位所需技能且在班次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 在岗的技师数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是班次时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{s,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该班次的可用率（扣除既定休息、培训与设备维护）。这个式子在工程上最重要的作用是：它把&quot;技师休假&quot;和&quot;工具只有一把&quot;这两件事自动反映进了容量，而不是靠人工在派单前提醒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作业时长-一个必须按机型分层的分布\">作业时长：一个必须按机型分层的分布</h2><p>把一个网点全部维修业务的平均作业时长当成一个常数，是容量模型里最贵的一类简化。真实的作业时长分布有三个特征：<strong>右偏</strong>（少数疑难单占用远超平均的时间）、<strong>按维修等级分层</strong>（L1 模块更换与 L2 板级维修差一个数量级）、以及<strong>受首次检测质量影响</strong>（检测不充分会导致返工）。</p>\n<p>因此容量的计算不应当用均值，而应当用<strong>分位数</strong>。若一个网点承诺的时效是&quot;95% 的维修单在 10 个工作日内完成&quot;，那么它需要按 95 分位的作业时长来预留工时，而不是按均值。用均值计算会得到一个乐观到无法兑现的承诺——这正是&quot;受理了但躺着不动&quot;现象的数学来源：派单时按均值算有空位，实际消耗按尾部发生，于是队列迅速堆积。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维修等级</th>\n<th>典型作业时长（工位小时）</th>\n<th>时长分布形态</th>\n<th>对容量的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 整机换新</td>\n<td>0.2–0.5</td>\n<td>近似确定</td>\n<td>几乎不占用维修工位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 模块更换</td>\n<td>0.5–1.5</td>\n<td>窄，右偏轻</td>\n<td>可用均值近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 板级维修</td>\n<td>2–6</td>\n<td>宽，右偏重</td>\n<td>必须用高分位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 元件级返修</td>\n<td>4–16</td>\n<td>极宽，含失败重试</td>\n<td>必须用高分位 + 失败率修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测/质检</td>\n<td>0.3–1.0</td>\n<td>窄</td>\n<td>可均摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表还揭示了一个运营上的杠杆：如果一个网点 80% 的单是 L1，它的容量模型可以用均值近似；如果 80% 是 L2/L3，均值近似会带来系统性的过度承诺。因此在实现上，容量应当<strong>按维修等级分别维护</strong>，而不是给网点一个总的&quot;日产能&quot;。分派器按作业类型去取对应的可用量，才能得到正确的判断。作业类型的判定依赖 <a href=\"service-point-capability\">网点能力标签</a> 里的维修等级分层与检测结果——这也是为什么能力模型必须分层而不能是一个布尔值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排班-时区与节假日\">排班、时区与节假日</h2><p>在跨国网络里，排班数据的处理有三个容易被忽略的细节，它们都会以&quot;承诺了但没做到&quot;的形式显现。</p>\n<p><strong>时区</strong>。一个承诺&quot;5 个工作日&quot;的时效，起算点应当是网点所在地的工作日历还是用户所在地的？两个时区相差 12 小时时，同一张单在两个口径下会差出一个完整工作日。工程上的做法是：内部一律用网点的日历计算可执行工时（因为产能只在网点的工作时间存在），但对外承诺的时效用用户所在地的日历换算（因为用户感知的是自己的工作日）。这个换算关系必须显式建模，不能靠&quot;大概差不多&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>节假日</strong>。每个国家的法定节假日不同，且调休规则频繁变化。这类数据必须来自可更新的日历服务而不是硬编码——把节假日写死在代码里，等于承诺在明年的某个节日一定会失效。</p>\n<p><strong>班次内的可用率</strong>。排班表上的&quot;在岗&quot;不等于&quot;可分配&quot;。例会、培训、设备校准、以及不得不处理的返修单都会消耗工时。可用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{s,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应当由历史数据估计而不是拍一个常数；一个实用的起点是把过去若干周的实际有效工时除以表定工时，并按季节更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可承诺量-atp-与在制品\">可承诺量（ATP）与在制品</h2><p>可承诺量的定义借用了销售库存里的 ATP（available-to-promise）概念，但要加上在制品的占用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP_{t} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{H_{avail,t} \\cdot (1 - \\beta)}{ \\bar{d}_{p95}} \\right\\rfloor - WIP_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4573em;vertical-align:-1.0073em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2788em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0073em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_{p95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1173em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该类作业的 95 分位作业时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是为返修与加急预留的缓冲比例（通常 10%–20%），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该网点当前在制品换算成工位小时后的占用。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一项是整条公式里最容易被漏掉的：一个网点即使这周的排班全空，只要它手上还有二十台没修完的机器，它的真实可承诺量就是负的。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的计算需要网点回传每台在修机器的当前状态与开始时间。这份数据的可靠性取决于网点信息系统的接入程度——自营网点通常可以实时回传，第三方网点往往只能每日批量。可靠性差异必须体现在置信区间上：批量回传的网点，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 应当给出一个更宽的区间，并在分派打分里被保守对待。分派器如何消费这个区间，见 <a href=\"../service-dispatch/smart-dispatch-rule\">按距离/能力/容量智能分派</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量的弹性与超载保护\">容量的弹性与超载保护</h2><p>容量不是一个只能被动观测的数字，它有几个可控的弹性杠杆，但每一个都有代价，需要在系统里被显式建模而不是默认开启。</p>\n<p><strong>加班与加开班次</strong>可以在短期内提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{avail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，代价是人效下降与技师流失风险上升。系统应当允许配置一个&quot;加急溢价&quot;，让分派器在缺件成本高于加班成本时选择加班而不是跨区调货——这个权衡的对手方是第三章的调拨决策。</p>\n<p><strong>外包溢出</strong>是把超出容量的单转给邻近网点或第三方。它的前提是这些网点有能力标签（第一篇的三元组）且愿意接，因此溢出的候选集来自能力匹配而非人工指派。</p>\n<p><strong>排队而非拒绝</strong>是最常用也最危险的杠杆。让网点&quot;先接单排队&quot;在短期看起来提高了利用率，但它把超时风险从一个可知的拒单变成了一个不可知的延迟。可用的做法是给每个网点设一个<strong>队列水位上限</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过某个阈值时，该网点从分派的候选中被自动摘除，而不是继续接单。这个阈值应当按照它承诺时效的反解来定——即&quot;再接多少台会让已接的单必然超时&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需求到达] --&gt; B{ATP &gt; 0?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[正常派单]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{WIP 超过水位上限?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[可接受排队&lt;br/&gt;需重算承诺时效]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{加班可用且划算?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[提升 H_avail 后接单]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H{邻近网点可溢出?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[溢出派单]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[拒单或转其他处置]&#10;    J --&gt; K[交第二章 2.2 处置分流]\">graph TD\n    A[需求到达] --&gt; B{ATP &gt; 0?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[正常派单]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{WIP 超过水位上限?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[可接受排队&lt;br/&gt;需重算承诺时效]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{加班可用且划算?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[提升 H_avail 后接单]\n    F --&gt;|否| H{邻近网点可溢出?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[溢出派单]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[拒单或转其他处置]\n    J --&gt; K[交第二章 2.2 处置分流]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>思维上把容量当作<strong>随时间变化的函数</strong>而非标量：定义必须包含时间窗、按机型的作业时长假设、可用工时口径与在制品占用。</li>\n<li>可用工时是<strong>技能、工具、工位三者约束下的最小值</strong>，不是物理工位数；技师休假与独占工具都会自动反映进来。</li>\n<li>作业时长分布右偏且按维修等级分层，容量计算应使用<strong>分位数而非均值</strong>，并按维修等级分别维护，而不是一个总日产能。</li>\n<li>在跨国网络里，时区、节假日与班次内可用率三个细节都会以&quot;承诺了没做到&quot;显现；节假日数据必须可更新，可用率应由历史估计。</li>\n<li>可承诺量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 必须扣除在制品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的可靠性取决于网点信息系统接入程度，差异应体现在置信区间上。</li>\n<li>容量的弹性杠杆（加班、溢出、排队）都有代价，排队必须配一个<strong>队列水位上限</strong>来防止过度承诺。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网点处理容量与排班","id":"网点处理容量与排班"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"作业时长：一个必须按机型分层的分布","id":"作业时长-一个必须按机型分层的分布"},{"level":2,"text":"排班、时区与节假日","id":"排班-时区与节假日"},{"level":2,"text":"可承诺量（ATP）与在制品","id":"可承诺量-atp-与在制品"},{"level":2,"text":"容量的弹性与超载保护","id":"容量的弹性与超载保护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网点能力标签（品类/品牌/维修等级）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-network-capacity/service-point-capability"},"next":{"title":"网点备件可用性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-network-capacity/spare-parts-availability"}}